      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GO WALLY GO (7) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors five starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (20.08) at Healesville over 350m. Rates highly and will give a great sight. READY TO BURN (5) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Miss Chapo (18.07) in a Grade 6/MDN. Has the pace to be prominent. Will give a great sight again. FLASHY PHIL (4) is on debut and has a tricky draw to overcome. Ratings suggest a place chance. TABASCO FIASCO (8) is a newcomer from the William Hartigan kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Expected to produce a bold debut.",
